## FINAL BUSINESS RULES

1. No unapproved farmer or drone pilot may access restricted operational features.
2. Only approved and eligible pilots can receive operational bookings.
3. Farmer and pilot accounts must be independently verified.
4. Live GPS tracking must use actual Android device location and be permission-based, disclosed and restricted to authorized operational periods.
5. Every active order must have an auditable status timeline.
6. Spraying completion must require operation evidence and the configured verification process.
7. GPS presence alone is not proof of spraying completion.
8. Farmer payments must be verified by the backend.
9. Pilot earnings must be calculated from verified bookings and approved settlement rules.
10. Payouts must not be marked successful until confirmed by the payout provider or verified bank process.
11. Penalties must have a documented reason, review process and appeal mechanism.
12. Financial changes must be auditable and must never silently overwrite historical transactions.
13. Super Admin must control pricing, commissions, verification rules, settlement rules, penalties, permissions and operational settings.
14. The farmer app, pilot app and admin dashboard must share the same secure backend and consistent live order data.
15. Build this as a production-ready functional system, not merely a UI prototype.